@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Me | Return to Self Reiki</PageTitle>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-navy">About Me</span>
        <h1>Hi, I'm so glad you're here.</h1>
        <p>Grounded, intuitive, heart-centered energy healing for your journey back to yourself.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-preview light">
    <div class="about-preview-media" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="about-preview-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">My Story</span>
        <h2>A practice rooted in presence</h2>
        <p>
            My own healing journey led me to Reiki at a time when I needed to slow down,
            listen inward, and release what I had been carrying. What I found was a
            practice that didn't just calm my body, but helped me reconnect with who I
            really am underneath the noise.
        </p>
        <p>
            Since then, I've trained and practiced with the intention of holding that
            same space for others &mdash; a quiet, supportive place to release, restore,
            and return to yourself.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow">My Approach</span>
            <h2>How I Hold Space for You</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="benefits-grid">
            <div class="benefit">
                <div class="benefit-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21s-6.5-4.1-9-8.6C1 8.6 2.9 5 6.5 5 9 5 10.8 6.3 12 8.1 13.2 6.3 15 5 17.5 5 21.1 5 23 8.6 21 12.4 18.5 16.9 12 21 12 21Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Grounded</h3>
                <p>Every session begins with presence &mdash; no rushing, just space to arrive.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit">
                <div class="benefit-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3v2.4M12 18.6V21M21 12h-2.4M5.4 12H3M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Intuitive</h3>
                <p>I follow what your energy needs in the moment, not a fixed script.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit">
                <div class="benefit-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-9.5-9C.6 7.4 2.5 4 6 4c2 0 3.5 1.1 4.5 2.6C11.5 5.1 13 4 15 4c3.5 0 5.4 3.4 3.5 7-2.5 4.6-9.5 9-9.5 9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Heart-Centered</h3>
                <p>You're met with compassion, never judgment, exactly as you are.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit">
                <div class="benefit-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /><path d="M9 12h6M12 9v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Safe &amp; Supportive</h3>
                <p>A confidential space held just for you and your healing process.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section alt">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center">
        <div class="section-heading" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
            <span class="eyebrow">Ready When You Are</span>
            <h2>Let's Begin Your Healing Journey</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-navy" href="contact">
            Schedule Now
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
